1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:02,900
(Penny:)I'm your best friend?

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,630
(Amy:)Don't you read my blog?

3
00:00:04,630 --> 00:00:06,400
(Penny:)Oh, don't feel bad.

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,000
(Penny:)I never read Leonard's, and
I used to sleep with him.

5
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:14,170
(Amy:)Do you know anybody else
who would appreciate

6
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:15,610
(Amy:)an all-expense-paid spa weekend

7
00:00:15,610 --> 00:00:17,080
(Amy:)at a four-star resort
in Big Sur?

8
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:19,980
(Penny:)No, I really-- I'm sorry,
free what? Sorry, what, what?

9
00:00:19,980 --> 00:00:22,050
(Leonard:)I think her weekend
just opened up.

10
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:25,250
(Penny:)Wait, wait, just to be clear,
when you guys say "spa,"

11
00:00:25,250 --> 00:00:28,490
(Penny:)does that mean the same thing
as when regular people say it?

12
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:29,760
(Leonard:)Pretty much.

13
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:32,490
(Leonard:)Except we keep
our shirts on in the sauna.

14
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:34,930
(Penny:)You know, it is going
to be difficult,

15
00:00:34,930 --> 00:00:38,060
(Penny:)but I'm going to cancel my plans
so I can do this for my bestie.

16
00:00:38,070 --> 00:00:39,900
(Amy:)Please don't touch my breasts.

17
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:42,470
(Penny:)I... I wasn't going to.

18
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:45,170
(Amy:)All right. I just want
to establish boundaries.

19
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:47,870
(Penny:)Boy, this is great. I haven't
had a vacation in ages.

20
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:51,240
(Sheldon:)In order to take a vacation,
one first has to work.

21
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:53,180
(Penny:)You know, for a smart guy,

22
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:55,380
(Penny:)you really seem to have a
hard time grasping the concept

23
00:00:55,380 --> 00:00:58,720
"don't piss off the people
who handle the things you eat."

24
00:00:58,720 --> 00:01:01,860
(Amy:)That does seem to be
a valid principle.

25
00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:04,090
(Sheldon:)I trust Penny will adhere to

26
00:01:04,090 --> 00:01:05,890
the "Official California
Restaurant Workers'

27
00:01:05,890 --> 00:01:08,230
(Sheldon:)Solemn Oath of Ethics
and Cleanliness."

28
00:01:08,230 --> 00:01:10,630
(Amy:)I don't believe
there's any such thing.

29
00:01:11,570 --> 00:01:14,400
(Sheldon:)You lied to me?

